(* The fault can occur at all.

   If APP_PARTIAL_SUBMISSION is unreachable then every property about what
   follows it is vacuously satisfied, and the test case generated from the
   matching purpose would exercise nothing. This has happened in this model
   before: a synchronised gate one side never offered was SILENTLY DELETED from
   the composition, the build still succeeded, and the state space just shrank.

   Expected: TRUE
*)
< true* . "APP_PARTIAL_SUBMISSION" > true
